# INVWINCV.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the windows
# that hold a list left to be painted again with the focus given back
# meanwhile (the driver's C line), as a switch to another program lying
# over them and back leaves them.  The list with the focus, which
# Windows paints as it takes the focus, before its parent is erased,
# shows its rows afterwards, none BLANK: the item list, the location
# tree, the contents beside it, and the locations' pick list in its
# dialog, from Record > Move.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINCV.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
C
S ITEMS
K ALT-L B
C
S TREE
K F6
C
S CONTENTS
K ALT-C M
K F4
C
S PICK
K ESC ESC
K ALT-F X
